{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-28799","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36348","text":"Tracks · Reel · Replay — session handoff"}]},{"id":"blk-28800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36349","marks":["bold"],"text":"Written 2026-08-15. Continue development from this file."}]},{"id":"blk-28801","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36350","text":"Read "},{"id":"spn-36351","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/RUNBOOK.md"},{"id":"spn-36352","text":" first for the shell in general; this covers only the tracks/reel/replay work and the deploy loop that made it testable."}]},{"id":"blk-28802","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36353","text":"1. The deploy loop — read this before anything else"}]},{"id":"blk-28803","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36354","text":"The dev host "},{"id":"spn-36355","marks":["bold"],"text":"cannot run the 3D shell"},{"id":"spn-36356","text":": two other sessions hold the WebGL context pool, so "},{"id":"spn-36357","marks":["code"],"text":"buildWorld"},{"id":"spn-36358","text":" throws and "},{"id":"spn-36359","marks":["code"],"text":"createDash"},{"id":"spn-36360","text":" never runs. That means no dash, no gate, no driving, and no screenshots worth taking. "},{"id":"spn-36361","marks":["bold"],"text":"The FreeBSD guest is the test environment."},{"id":"spn-36362","text":" Everything below exists because of that."}]},{"id":"blk-28804","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36363","text":"Getting a build into the guest"}]},{"id":"blk-28805","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"cd /home/travis/ProjectAmp2/RRABBIT && npm run build\ntar czf /tmp/rrabbit-dist.tgz dist\nscp -P 2224 /tmp/rrabbit-dist.tgz driver@127.0.0.1:/tmp/\nssh -p 2224 driver@127.0.0.1 'rm -rf $HOME/rrabbit/dist.new && mkdir -p $HOME/rrabbit/dist.new && tar xzf /tmp/rrabbit-dist.tgz -C $HOME/rrabbit/dist.new --strip-components=1 && rm -rf $HOME/rrabbit/dist.prev && mv $HOME/rrabbit/dist $HOME/rrabbit/dist.prev && mv $HOME/rrabbit/dist.new $HOME/rrabbit/dist && sha256 -q $HOME/rrabbit/dist/assets/shell-*.js'"},{"id":"blk-28806","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36364","text":"Then "},{"id":"spn-36365","marks":["bold"],"text":"Ctrl+R in the shell"},{"id":"spn-36366","text":". No reboot, no logout — it is a page in a Firefox kiosk."}]},{"id":"blk-28807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36367","text":"Compare the printed hash against "},{"id":"spn-36368","marks":["code"],"text":"sha256sum dist/assets/shell-*.js"},{"id":"spn-36369","text":" on the host. They must match."}]},{"id":"blk-28808","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36370","text":"Why it goes to "},{"id":"spn-36371","marks":["code"],"text":"$HOME/rrabbit"},{"id":"spn-36372","text":" and not "},{"id":"spn-36373","marks":["code"],"text":"/usr/local/share/rrabbit"}]},{"id":"blk-28809","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36374","marks":["code"],"text":"driver"},{"id":"spn-36375","text":" "},{"id":"spn-36376","marks":["bold"],"text":"is not in the sudoers file"},{"id":"spn-36377","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-36378","marks":["code"],"text":"sudo"},{"id":"spn-36379","text":" fails regardless of password) and the shipped directory is "},{"id":"spn-36380","marks":["code"],"text":"root:wheel 0755"},{"id":"spn-36381","text":". "},{"id":"spn-36382","marks":["code"],"text":"driver"},{"id":"spn-36383","text":" is in "},{"id":"spn-36384","marks":["code"],"text":"wheel"},{"id":"spn-36385","text":" but the group has no write bit."}]},{"id":"blk-28810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36386","marks":["code"],"text":"rrabbit-session"},{"id":"spn-36387","text":" was written with the escape hatch — "},{"id":"spn-36388","marks":["italic"],"text":"\"Overridable so the session logic can be exercised off-target\""},{"id":"spn-36389","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-28811","kind":"code","language":"sh","text":"RRABBIT_DIR=${RRABBIT_DIR:-/usr/local/share/rrabbit}\nBRIDGE=$RRABBIT_DIR/bridge.py"},{"id":"blk-28812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36390","text":"and "},{"id":"spn-36391","marks":["code"],"text":"bridge.py"},{"id":"spn-36392","text":" serves the "},{"id":"spn-36393","marks":["code"],"text":"dist"},{"id":"spn-36394","text":" "},{"id":"spn-36395","marks":["bold"],"text":"beside itself"},{"id":"spn-36396","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-36397","marks":["code"],"text":"DIST = dirname(abspath(__file__)) + \"/dist\""},{"id":"spn-36398","text":"). So a user-owned copy is a complete install. "},{"id":"spn-36399","marks":["code"],"text":"~/.xprofile"},{"id":"spn-36400","text":" sets it, and SDDM's "},{"id":"spn-36401","marks":["code"],"text":"Xsession"},{"id":"spn-36402","text":" sources "},{"id":"spn-36403","marks":["code"],"text":"$HOME/.profile"},{"id":"spn-36404","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-36405","marks":["code"],"text":"$HOME/.xprofile"},{"id":"spn-36406","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36407","marks":["bold"],"text":"To revert to the shipped shell:"},{"id":"spn-36408","text":" delete "},{"id":"spn-36409","marks":["code"],"text":"~/.xprofile"},{"id":"spn-36410","text":" and log in again. Nothing under "},{"id":"spn-36411","marks":["code"],"text":"/usr/local"},{"id":"spn-36412","text":" was touched."}]},{"id":"blk-28814","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36413","text":"Guest access"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-28816","spans":[{"id":"spn-36414","text":""}]},{"id":"blk-28817","spans":[{"id":"spn-36415","text":""}]}],"id":"blk-28815","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-28818","spans":[{"id":"spn-36416","text":"VM"}]},{"id":"blk-28819","spans":[{"id":"spn-36417","marks":["code"],"text":"tandr-preview"},{"id":"spn-36418","text":", libvirt "},{"id":"spn-36419","marks":["bold"],"text":"user session"},{"id":"spn-36420","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-36421","marks":["code"],"text":"virsh -c qemu:///session"},{"id":"spn-36422","text":")"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28820","spans":[{"id":"spn-36423","text":"Network"}]},{"id":"blk-28821","spans":[{"id":"spn-36424","text":"usermode, "},{"id":"spn-36425","marks":["code"],"text":"hostfwd=tcp:127.0.0.1:2224-:22"},{"id":"spn-36426","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-36427","marks":["bold"],"text":"there is no guest IP"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28822","spans":[{"id":"spn-36428","text":"ssh"}]},{"id":"blk-28823","spans":[{"id":"spn-36429","marks":["code"],"text":"ssh -p 2224 driver@127.0.0.1"},{"id":"spn-36430","text":", key auth is installed"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28824","spans":[{"id":"spn-36431","text":"sudo"}]},{"id":"blk-28825","spans":[{"id":"spn-36432","marks":["bold"],"text":"unavailable"},{"id":"spn-36433","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-36434","marks":["code"],"text":"driver is not in the sudoers file"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28826","spans":[{"id":"spn-36435","text":"Screenshot without any credentials"}]},{"id":"blk-28827","spans":[{"id":"spn-36436","marks":["code"],"text":"virsh -c qemu:///session screenshot tandr-preview out.ppm"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-28828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36437","marks":["code"],"text":"virsh screenshot"},{"id":"spn-36438","text":" is the highest-value probe here — it reaches the greeter, a failed session, and anything ssh cannot see. It caught a deploy that had never happened when the AHEAD mirror still read old text."}]},{"id":"blk-28829","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36439","text":"Two host traps"}]},{"id":"blk-28830","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28832","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36440","marks":["bold"],"text":"`cd` does not persist between tool calls."},{"id":"spn-36441","text":" Every build/deploy command must start with"}]}],"id":"blk-28831","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28833","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36442","marks":["code"],"text":"cd /home/travis/ProjectAmp2/RRABBIT"},{"id":"spn-36443","text":". A build \"failing\" with "},{"id":"spn-36444","marks":["code"],"text":"npm error"},{"id":"spn-36445","text":" is usually this."}]},{"id":"blk-28834","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36446","marks":["bold"],"text":"Vite's dev server versions module URLs."},{"id":"spn-36447","text":" "},{"id":"spn-36448","marks":["code"],"text":"await import('/m2/tracks.js')"},{"id":"spn-36449","text":" in a console gets a"}]}],"id":"blk-28835","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28837","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36450","marks":["bold"],"text":"different instance"},{"id":"spn-36451","text":" than "},{"id":"spn-36452","marks":["code"],"text":"travel.js"},{"id":"spn-36453","text":" holds, so any cross-module probe on "},{"id":"spn-36454","marks":["code"],"text":"localhost:8914"},{"id":"spn-36455","text":" measures two parallel copies and proves nothing. The built bundle has one instance (verified). Test through the "},{"id":"spn-36456","marks":["code"],"text":"window.__*"},{"id":"spn-36457","text":" globals, which close over the real graph."}]},{"id":"blk-28838","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36458","text":"2. What is built"}]},{"id":"blk-28839","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36459","text":"Tracks — "},{"id":"spn-36460","marks":["code"],"text":"m2/tracks.js"}]},{"id":"blk-28840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36461","text":"Was ten fixed slots; now "},{"id":"spn-36462","marks":["bold"],"text":"sparse 1–999, created on demand"},{"id":"spn-36463","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28841","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28843","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36464","marks":["code"],"text":"Map"},{"id":"spn-36465","text":" keyed by id, not a dense array. "},{"id":"spn-36466","marks":["code"],"text":"ensure(300)"},{"id":"spn-36467","text":" costs one entry, not three hundred."}]}],"id":"blk-28842","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36468","text":"Fresh shell starts with "},{"id":"spn-36469","marks":["bold"],"text":"one"},{"id":"spn-36470","text":" track, not zero."}]}],"id":"blk-28844","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28847","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36471","marks":["code"],"text":"remove()"},{"id":"spn-36472","text":" refuses the last track — the gantry reads a label and the map draws a marker; there is"}]}],"id":"blk-28846","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28848","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36473","text":"no state for \"no track\"."}]},{"id":"blk-28849","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28851","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36474","text":"Store key "},{"id":"spn-36475","marks":["code"],"text":"rrabbit.tracks.v2"},{"id":"spn-36476","text":". "},{"id":"spn-36477","marks":["code"],"text":"load()"},{"id":"spn-36478","text":" treats a saved set as untrusted input from an older build,"}]}],"id":"blk-28850","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28852","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36479","text":"which is why v1 needed no migration."}]},{"id":"blk-28853","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36480","marks":["bold"],"text":"The digit grammar is bounded by the population, not the ceiling."},{"id":"spn-36481","text":" "},{"id":"spn-36482","marks":["code"],"text":"canGrow(prefix)"},{"id":"spn-36483","text":" asks whether any track that "},{"id":"spn-36484","marks":["italic"],"text":"exists"},{"id":"spn-36485","text":" has this as a proper prefix. With nine or fewer tracks nothing can grow, so every switch commits on the keystroke and the 600 ms timer never runs. "},{"id":"spn-36486","marks":["bold"],"text":"1–999 is faster than the fixed 10 was."},{"id":"spn-36487","text":" Reading "},{"id":"spn-36488","marks":["code"],"text":"MAX"},{"id":"spn-36489","text":" here instead would make every single-digit press wait."}]},{"id":"blk-28854","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36490","text":"The recording — the trail is not the log"}]},{"id":"blk-28855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36491","marks":["code"],"text":"history"},{"id":"spn-36492","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-36493","marks":["code"],"text":"rec"},{"id":"spn-36494","text":" are separate and must stay separate:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-28857","spans":[{"id":"spn-36495","text":""}]},{"id":"blk-28858","spans":[{"id":"spn-36496","marks":["code"],"text":"history"}]},{"id":"blk-28859","spans":[{"id":"spn-36497","marks":["code"],"text":"rec"}]}],"id":"blk-28856","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-28860","spans":[{"id":"spn-36498","text":"job"}]},{"id":"blk-28861","spans":[{"id":"spn-36499","text":"what "},{"id":"spn-36500","marks":["code"],"text":"back"},{"id":"spn-36501","text":" can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-28862","spans":[{"id":"spn-36502","text":"what happened"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28863","spans":[{"id":"spn-36503","marks":["code"],"text":"back"}]},{"id":"blk-28864","spans":[{"id":"spn-36504","marks":["bold"],"text":"truncates it"}]},{"id":"blk-28865","spans":[{"id":"spn-36505","text":"never touches it"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28866","spans":[{"id":"spn-36506","text":"cap"}]},{"id":"blk-28867","spans":[{"id":"spn-36507","text":"32, silently shifted"}]},{"id":"blk-28868","spans":[{"id":"spn-36508","marks":["code"],"text":"REC_MAX"},{"id":"spn-36509","text":" 4096, loss counted in "},{"id":"spn-36510","marks":["code"],"text":"recCut"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28869","spans":[{"id":"spn-36511","text":"contents"}]},{"id":"blk-28870","spans":[{"id":"spn-36512","text":"road ids only"}]},{"id":"blk-28871","spans":[{"id":"spn-36513","marks":["code"],"text":"go"},{"id":"spn-36514","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36515","marks":["code"],"text":"land"},{"id":"spn-36516","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36517","marks":["code"],"text":"in"},{"id":"spn-36518","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36519","marks":["code"],"text":"out"},{"id":"spn-36520","text":", with relative "},{"id":"spn-36521","marks":["code"],"text":"t"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-28872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36522","text":"A short trail beside a long recording means you reversed out of somewhere. That gap is the honest picture and both columns are shown in the reel because of it."}]},{"id":"blk-28873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36523","marks":["code"],"text":"arrive(id, {record:false})"},{"id":"spn-36524","text":" still records — as "},{"id":"spn-36525","marks":["code"],"text":"land"},{"id":"spn-36526","text":". A restore is not on the trail but it "},{"id":"spn-36527","marks":["italic"],"text":"did happen"},{"id":"spn-36528","text":", and a log that omitted it could not be replayed: the next step would start from a road the replayer was never told it was on."}]},{"id":"blk-28874","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36529","marks":["code"],"text":"prune()"},{"id":"spn-36530","text":" deliberately does "},{"id":"spn-36531","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-36532","text":" touch "},{"id":"spn-36533","marks":["code"],"text":"rec"},{"id":"spn-36534","text":". "},{"id":"spn-36535","marks":["code"],"text":"at"},{"id":"spn-36536","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-36537","marks":["code"],"text":"roads"},{"id":"spn-36538","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-36539","marks":["code"],"text":"history"},{"id":"spn-36540","text":" are claims about where you can go now; "},{"id":"spn-36541","marks":["code"],"text":"rec"},{"id":"spn-36542","text":" is a claim about what happened and stays true after a road is gone."}]},{"id":"blk-28875","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36543","text":"The reel — "},{"id":"spn-36544","marks":["code"],"text":"m2/reel.js"},{"id":"spn-36545","text":", gear "},{"id":"spn-36546","marks":["bold"],"text":"R"}]},{"id":"blk-28876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36547","text":"Not a key. "},{"id":"spn-36548","marks":["code"],"text":"dash.js"},{"id":"spn-36549","text":" has had "},{"id":"spn-36550","marks":["code"],"text":"{ id: 'R', name: 'REEL' }"},{"id":"spn-36551","text":" all along and "},{"id":"spn-36552","marks":["code"],"text":"setGear"},{"id":"spn-36553","text":" refuses anything in "},{"id":"spn-36554","marks":["code"],"text":"unbuilt"},{"id":"spn-36555","text":"; the scene existing is all R was waiting for. "},{"id":"spn-36556","marks":["code"],"text":"unbuilt"},{"id":"spn-36557","text":" is now "},{"id":"spn-36558","marks":["code"],"text":"['P','C']"},{"id":"spn-36559","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36560","text":"Per row: "},{"id":"spn-36561","marks":["code"],"text":"drive"},{"id":"spn-36562","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36563","marks":["code"],"text":"replay"},{"id":"spn-36564","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36565","marks":["code"],"text":"walk"},{"id":"spn-36566","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36567","marks":["code"],"text":"clear rec"},{"id":"spn-36568","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-36569","marks":["code"],"text":"delete"},{"id":"spn-36570","text":", plus live rename and a make-box. "},{"id":"spn-36571","marks":["code"],"text":"walk"},{"id":"spn-36572","text":" is the same replay started paused."}]},{"id":"blk-28878","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36573","text":"Mutual exclusion with the map is enforced "},{"id":"spn-36574","marks":["bold"],"text":"by the callers"},{"id":"spn-36575","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-36576","marks":["code"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-36577","text":" in travel.js, "},{"id":"spn-36578","marks":["code"],"text":"onGear"},{"id":"spn-36579","text":" in shell.js) so "},{"id":"spn-36580","marks":["code"],"text":"map.js"},{"id":"spn-36581","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-36582","marks":["code"],"text":"reel.js"},{"id":"spn-36583","text":" never import each other."}]},{"id":"blk-28879","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36584","text":"Replay — "},{"id":"spn-36585","marks":["code"],"text":"precheck"},{"id":"spn-36586","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-36587","marks":["code"],"text":"perform"},{"id":"spn-36588","text":" / transport"}]},{"id":"blk-28880","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36589","marks":["bold"],"text":"A macro repeats; a track checks."},{"id":"spn-36590","text":" Two phases, and the split is forced not chosen:"}]},{"id":"blk-28881","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28883","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36591","marks":["bold"],"text":"precheck"},{"id":"spn-36592","text":" — roads, before anything moves. A route whose third step names a deleted road never"}]}],"id":"blk-28882","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36593","text":"takes the first."}]},{"id":"blk-28885","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28887","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36594","marks":["bold"],"text":"at arrival"},{"id":"spn-36595","text":" — windows, which are not answerable in advance because surfaces arrive after the"}]}],"id":"blk-28886","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36596","text":"module loads. "},{"id":"spn-36597","marks":["code"],"text":"load()"},{"id":"spn-36598","text":" already made this split for "},{"id":"spn-36599","marks":["code"],"text":"in"},{"id":"spn-36600","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36601","text":"Refusals are typed "},{"id":"spn-36602","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_*"},{"id":"spn-36603","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-36604","marks":["code"],"text":"WRL_*"},{"id":"spn-36605","text":" — studbook §7.5: a caller should be able to tell which layer refused): "},{"id":"spn-36606","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_EMPTY"},{"id":"spn-36607","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36608","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_ROAD_GONE"},{"id":"spn-36609","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36610","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_ROAD_CLOSED"},{"id":"spn-36611","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36612","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_WINDOW_GONE"},{"id":"spn-36613","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36614","marks":["code"],"text":"TRACK_BUSY"},{"id":"spn-36615","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28890","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36616","marks":["bold"],"text":"No silent repair."},{"id":"spn-36617","text":" A step whose road is gone is refused by name, never remapped."}]},{"id":"blk-28891","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36618","text":"The transport bar ("},{"id":"spn-36619","marks":["code"],"text":"#transport"},{"id":"spn-36620","text":", z-44) reads an ordered list of discrete steps and never asks what a step "},{"id":"spn-36621","marks":["italic"],"text":"means"},{"id":"spn-36622","text":" — one "},{"id":"spn-36623","marks":["code"],"text":"phrase()"},{"id":"spn-36624","text":" function is its only contact with the kinds. "},{"id":"spn-36625","marks":["bold"],"text":"It survives the op vocabulary change intact."}]},{"id":"blk-28892","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36626","text":"Two rules that came out of use:"}]},{"id":"blk-28893","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28895","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36627","marks":["bold"],"text":"The end is a place to stand, not an exit."},{"id":"spn-36628","text":" Reaching the last step holds paused, so "},{"id":"spn-36629","marks":["code"],"text":"back"},{"id":"spn-36630","text":" stays"}]}],"id":"blk-28894","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36631","text":"live and you leave with "},{"id":"spn-36632","marks":["code"],"text":"[X]"},{"id":"spn-36633","text":" or Esc."}]},{"id":"blk-28897","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36634","marks":["bold"],"text":"A replay is a round trip."},{"id":"spn-36635","text":" Exiting returns you to the road "},{"id":"spn-36636","marks":["italic"],"text":"and window"},{"id":"spn-36637","text":" you were in when you"}]}],"id":"blk-28898","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28900","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36638","text":"pressed it, via "},{"id":"spn-36639","marks":["code"],"text":"driveToTrack"},{"id":"spn-36640","text":" (which releases, sets "},{"id":"spn-36641","marks":["code"],"text":"goingBack"},{"id":"spn-36642","text":" so the drive home is not recorded, and re-enters the window). If the road you started from is gone it stays put rather than guessing."}]},{"id":"blk-28901","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36643","marks":["bold"],"text":"Step back works only because ops record arrivals, not deltas"},{"id":"spn-36644","text":" — state after step k is fully described by step k, so going back is re-performing k−1, not reversing k. Forty wheel deltas cannot be rewound; "},{"id":"spn-36645","marks":["code"],"text":"park(road, z)"},{"id":"spn-36646","text":" can. That is the granularity rule paying off as a capability."}]},{"id":"blk-28902","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36647","text":"3. Bugs found, and the two lessons worth carrying"}]},{"id":"blk-28903","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36648","marks":["bold"],"text":"The one that cost four rounds:"}]},{"id":"blk-28904","kind":"code","language":"css","text":"#transport { display: flex; }      /* id-selector author rule */\n#transport[hidden] { display: none; }   /* ← required, was missing */"},{"id":"blk-28905","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36649","marks":["code"],"text":"display"},{"id":"spn-36650","text":" from an id selector outranks the UA's "},{"id":"spn-36651","marks":["code"],"text":"[hidden] { display: none }"},{"id":"spn-36652","text":", so "},{"id":"spn-36653","marks":["code"],"text":"el.hidden = true"},{"id":"spn-36654","text":" set the attribute and changed nothing. The bar was correctly told to hide "},{"id":"spn-36655","marks":["bold"],"text":"55 times"},{"id":"spn-36656","text":" and stayed up — so a replay that "},{"id":"spn-36657","marks":["italic"],"text":"had"},{"id":"spn-36658","text":" ended looked like one that would not stop."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28907","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36659","marks":["bold"],"text":"When a control \"does not respond\", measure whether its EFFECT is reaching the screen before measuring whether its INPUT is reaching the code."}]}],"id":"blk-28906","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-28908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36660","text":"And the instrument that misled me: once the replay stopped, the poll was cleared, so the counters froze. "},{"id":"spn-36661","marks":["code"],"text":"esc 4/0"},{"id":"spn-36662","text":" was a "},{"id":"spn-36663","marks":["bold"],"text":"stopped clock"},{"id":"spn-36664","text":" read as evidence about handlers."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36665","marks":["bold"],"text":"An instrument that stops updating reads as a measurement, not as silence."},{"id":"spn-36666","text":" Put a heartbeat on any counter you intend to trust."}]}],"id":"blk-28909","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-28911","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36667","text":"Two real bugs found while chasing it, both worth keeping fixed:"}]},{"id":"blk-28912","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36668","text":"Esc for replay was on a "},{"id":"spn-36669","marks":["bold"],"text":"bubble"},{"id":"spn-36670","text":" listener; three capture-phase branches in "},{"id":"spn-36671","marks":["code"],"text":"travel.js"},{"id":"spn-36672","text":" can stop"}]}],"id":"blk-28913","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28915","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36673","text":"propagation first. It lives in the capture listener now."}]},{"id":"blk-28916","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36674","text":"The flat-mode pointer "},{"id":"spn-36675","marks":["code"],"text":"swallow"},{"id":"spn-36676","text":" exempted only "},{"id":"spn-36677","marks":["code"],"text":"#map"},{"id":"spn-36678","text":". A replay step that "},{"id":"spn-36679","marks":["italic"],"text":"enters a window"},{"id":"spn-36680","text":" puts the"}]}],"id":"blk-28917","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28919","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36681","text":"shell in flat mode, which killed every button on the bar. Now exempts "},{"id":"spn-36682","marks":["code"],"text":"#transport, #reel, #map"},{"id":"spn-36683","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36684","marks":["bold"],"text":"Stale text removed"},{"id":"spn-36685","text":" (both were teaching the dead ten-track model): the "},{"id":"spn-36686","marks":["code"],"text":"#status"},{"id":"spn-36687","text":" hint panel and "},{"id":"spn-36688","marks":["code"],"text":"map.js"},{"id":"spn-36689","text":"'s key hint. "},{"id":"spn-36690","marks":["code"],"text":"#status"},{"id":"spn-36691","text":" is now "},{"id":"spn-36692","marks":["code"],"text":"hidden"},{"id":"spn-36693","text":" when empty — clearing the text left a bordered empty box — and both writers ("},{"id":"spn-36694","marks":["code"],"text":"say"},{"id":"spn-36695","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36696","marks":["code"],"text":"offerReload"},{"id":"spn-36697","text":") un-hide it, because a crash report in a hidden panel is a failure reported nowhere."}]},{"id":"blk-28921","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36698","marks":["bold"],"text":"Glyphs:"},{"id":"spn-36699","text":" "},{"id":"spn-36700","marks":["code"],"text":"⏮⏸▶⏭⏹"},{"id":"spn-36701","text":" are U+23Ex and the image's font has no such block — every button wore tofu. All controls are ASCII now: "},{"id":"spn-36702","marks":["code"],"text":"|< back"},{"id":"spn-36703","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36704","marks":["code"],"text":"> play"},{"id":"spn-36705","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36706","marks":["code"],"text":"|| pause"},{"id":"spn-36707","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36708","marks":["code"],"text":">| step"},{"id":"spn-36709","text":", "},{"id":"spn-36710","marks":["code"],"text":"[X]"},{"id":"spn-36711","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-28922","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36712","text":"4. Where this sits on the ladder"}]},{"id":"blk-28923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36713","marks":["code"],"text":"DRIVE → TRACK → REPLAY → GENERALIZE → AUTONOMOUS"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-28925","spans":[{"id":"spn-36714","text":"rung"}]},{"id":"blk-28926","spans":[{"id":"spn-36715","text":"status"}]}],"id":"blk-28924","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-28927","spans":[{"id":"spn-36716","text":"DRIVE"}]},{"id":"blk-28928","spans":[{"id":"spn-36717","marks":["code"],"text":"live_local"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28929","spans":[{"id":"spn-36718","text":"TRACK"}]},{"id":"blk-28930","spans":[{"id":"spn-36719","marks":["code"],"text":"live_local"},{"id":"spn-36720","text":" — sparse 1–999, reel, recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28931","spans":[{"id":"spn-36721","text":"REPLAY"}]},{"id":"blk-28932","spans":[{"id":"spn-36722","marks":["code"],"text":"live_local"},{"id":"spn-36723","text":" — preconditions, refusals, transport, round trip"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28933","spans":[{"id":"spn-36724","text":"GENERALIZE"}]},{"id":"blk-28934","spans":[{"id":"spn-36725","marks":["code"],"text":"spec"},{"id":"spn-36726","text":" — blocked on the op vocabulary"}]}],[{"id":"blk-28935","spans":[{"id":"spn-36727","text":"AUTONOMOUS"}]},{"id":"blk-28936","spans":[{"id":"spn-36728","marks":["code"],"text":"spec"},{"id":"spn-36729","text":" — WRLM D′ is step 4, unauthorized"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-28937","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36730","text":"5. What is next, and what is blocked on a ruling"}]},{"id":"blk-28938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36731","marks":["bold"],"text":"The op vocabulary is the next phase"},{"id":"spn-36732","text":" and it is a "},{"id":"spn-36733","marks":["bold"],"text":"[TRAVIS] decision"},{"id":"spn-36734","text":", not a task. Draft is at "},{"id":"spn-36735","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/RRABBIT/docs/OP_VOCABULARY_DRAFT.md"}],"text":"`docs/OP_VOCABULARY_DRAFT.md`"},{"id":"spn-36736","text":", beside this file."}]},{"id":"blk-28939","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36737","text":"Its argument in one line: the recording is an ad-hoc "},{"id":"spn-36738","marks":["code"],"text":"{t,k,…}"},{"id":"spn-36739","text":" shape, and adding the eleven missing verbs by accretion makes WRL permanently harder. A "},{"id":"spn-36740","marks":["bold"],"text":"closed vocabulary of ~16 typed ops through one seam"},{"id":"spn-36741","text":" gives recording, replay, transport, WRL, and the code editor one code path — "},{"id":"spn-36742","marks":["italic"],"text":"the vocabulary is the desktop API"},{"id":"spn-36743","text":", so there is no separate \"expose the API to WRL\" project."}]},{"id":"blk-28940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36744","text":"Granularity rule: "},{"id":"spn-36745","marks":["bold"],"text":"record the arrival, not the input."},{"id":"spn-36746","text":" Forty wheel notches is a macro; "},{"id":"spn-36747","marks":["code"],"text":"park(road, z)"},{"id":"spn-36748","text":" is a track."}]},{"id":"blk-28941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36749","text":"Five rulings in §8 of that draft. "},{"id":"spn-36750","marks":["bold"],"text":"§7 has a deadline"},{"id":"spn-36751","text":": existing recordings get discarded, which is cheap now and expensive once tracks have been published."}]},{"id":"blk-28942","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36752","text":"Known gaps in what shipped"}]},{"id":"blk-28943","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28945","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36753","marks":["bold"],"text":"Recording covers 4 of ~15 verbs."},{"id":"spn-36754","text":" No lane scrolling ("},{"id":"spn-36755","marks":["code"],"text":"parkRoad"},{"id":"spn-36756","text":"), no window clicks, no resize,"}]}],"id":"blk-28944","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36757","text":"no program launch. Deliberately not fixed by adding kinds — see above."}]},{"id":"blk-28947","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28949","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36758","text":"The check/use race is "},{"id":"spn-36759","marks":["bold"],"text":"narrowed, not closed"},{"id":"spn-36760","text":". A road can still go away between "},{"id":"spn-36761","marks":["code"],"text":"checkStep"},{"id":"spn-36762","text":" and"}]}],"id":"blk-28948","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36763","text":"the drive. Stated in the code, not claimed away."}]},{"id":"blk-28951","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28953","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36764","text":"Preconditions are hand-written JS, not data. They should become "},{"id":"spn-36765","marks":["code"],"text":"GoalSpecV1"},{"id":"spn-36766","text":"'s "},{"id":"spn-36767","marks":["italic"],"text":"shape"},{"id":"spn-36768","text":" — closed"}]}],"id":"blk-28952","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36769","text":"AST, bounded, total, "},{"id":"spn-36770","marks":["bold"],"text":"sealed into the track's identity"},{"id":"spn-36771","text":" so a track cannot be edited to weaken its own guard."}]},{"id":"blk-28955","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-36772","text":"6. Uncommitted, and the other open work"}]},{"id":"blk-28956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36773","text":"Seven files modified and "},{"id":"spn-36774","marks":["bold"],"text":"not committed"},{"id":"spn-36775","text":" as of writing:"}]},{"id":"blk-28957","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"m2/index.html  m2/map.js  m2/reel.js  m2/shell.js  m2/tracks.js  m2/travel.js  m2/world.js"},{"id":"blk-28958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36776","text":"Last commit on the branch is "},{"id":"spn-36777","marks":["code"],"text":"643ced8"},{"id":"spn-36778","text":", which is another session's."}]},{"id":"blk-28959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36779","text":"Elsewhere in the portfolio, from the same session:"}]},{"id":"blk-28960","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28962","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36780","marks":["code"],"text":"../../RECONCILIATION_LEDGER.md"},{"id":"spn-36781","text":" (repo root) — 9 defects, law count derived at "},{"id":"spn-36782","marks":["bold"],"text":"118"}]}],"id":"blk-28961","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36783","text":"("},{"id":"spn-36784","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_SITEMAP.md"},{"id":"spn-36785","text":" says 116, wrong in two places), 24 of 25 domains serve 200 ("},{"id":"spn-36786","marks":["code"],"text":"container.app"},{"id":"spn-36787","text":" does not resolve), WRLM 4/4 batteries green, and "},{"id":"spn-36788","marks":["bold"],"text":"D9: the generator prints 297 inhabited cells where the brief says 298"},{"id":"spn-36789","text":" — unresolved, one "},{"id":"spn-36790","marks":["code"],"text":"build_pool.py"},{"id":"spn-36791","text":" run settles it."}]},{"id":"blk-28964","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-28966","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36792","marks":["code"],"text":"../../COMPUTEDRIVEN_POSITIONING_PLAN.md"},{"id":"spn-36793","text":" (repo root) — portfolio tiering, T&R Cloud on"}]}],"id":"blk-28965","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-28967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36794","text":"Cloudflare R2, the WRLM/D′ section, risks R9–R13."}]},{"id":"blk-28968","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36795","text":"Both live at the repo root rather than under "},{"id":"spn-36796","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-36797","text":", which is the stackdocs aggregation site and would have swept them into the atlas build."}]},{"id":"blk-28969","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-36798","marks":["code"],"text":"/usr/local/share/rrabbit"},{"id":"spn-36799","text":" in the guest has "},{"id":"spn-36800","marks":["bold"],"text":"seven"},{"id":"spn-36801","text":" stale "},{"id":"spn-36802","marks":["code"],"text":"dist.*"},{"id":"spn-36803","text":" directories ("},{"id":"spn-36804","marks":["code"],"text":"dist.o3 dist.o4 dist.old dist.old2 dist.prev dist.prev2"},{"id":"spn-36805","text":"). Cleaning needs root."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera6nqqajmn44cu554goxiwwdcgi